{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44971","headline":"赠乌程李明府伯宜沈兵曹仲昌 · 皎然","name":"赠乌程李明府伯宜沈兵曹仲昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国苦雕瘵，东臯岂遗黍。\n云阴无尽时，日出常带雨。\n昨夜西溪涨，扁舟入檐庑。\n野人同鸟巢，暴客若蜂聚。\n岁晏无斗粟，寄身欲何所。\n空羡鸾鹤姿，翩翩自轻举。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}